'''Rover Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] increases damage and speed, decreases cost and gains [[Immune to Slow|Immunity to Slow]] and [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

