==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]], Rover Cat's descriptions all mistakenly stated that it was "Tough vs" Aliens, rather than Strong Against.
*Rover Cat resembles WALL-E from the Disney movie [[Wikipedia:WALL-E|WALL-E]].
*Rover Cat Mk II resembles the [[Wikipedia:BB-8|BB-8]] droid from ''[[Wikipedia:Star Wars|Star Wars]]''.
*The line, "Can find you be it on the opposite platform or in the windows along the alley," in Catellite's Japanese description is a reference to the song "[https://youtu.be/kEfzl77qTT0 One More Time, One More Chance]" by Masayoshi Yamazaki.
*NYASA is a portmanteau of ''NASA'' and ''nyan'', which is the Japanese onomatopoeia for a cat's meow.
*Catellite is a portmanteau of ''Cat'' and ''satellite''.
*Rover Cat's [[True Form]] in [[Nyanko Defence Force]] is a green version of Rover Cat Mk II instead of Catellite.

